  "_a_completer_apres_chargement_des_modeles": "bus 9 BRIT_COMP (attack 10ms, ratio 4:1, release 0.3s inférence, threshold -15, makeup +2) + SOLAR_69_EQ (mid 800 +2, high 8-10k +1 à +2) ; bus 11 FC_670 (thr ~-18, time constant 3) + ALPINE_EQ_550 (mid ~2k +2, high ~8k +1 shelf) ; bus 13 TUBE_CB Manual (attack Fast, release Medium, 4:1, -15, gain +2) + VINTAGE (low ~200 +2, L-mid +1, H-mid +2, high +2) ; bus 15 COMP_160 (output +10, 8-12 dB GR) + RC_500_EQ (100 flat, 250 -2, 3k +2) ; bus 16 STANDARD -18/3:1/10ms/auto ; master EVEREST_C100A (fast/fast, 1-2 dB GR) + PASSIVE (low boost +1 @60, high boost +1 @10k) ; FX A VintageReverb (predelay 40 ms, reflection modéré, LP 8k, LF damp 0), B StereoDelay (TAP, fb 40 %, LP 6k, HP 200, Fb LPF 5k), C DigitalXLReverb (predelay 20, reflection assez haut, size modéré, LPF 6-8k), D PingpongDelay (500 ms/TAP, fb 30 %, LP 5k, HP 300, Fb LPF 4k). Canaux : FET ch2 (attack 3 ms, release 150) et ch9 (attack 5, release 250) ; RC-500 ch8 (attack Fast, release Slow, makeup +3) ; Baxandall ch1 (low cut 30-40, low shelf 80-100 +1/+2, high shelf 3-4k +1/+2).",
